{"ref":"BDB, יֶ֫רֶד","hw":"יֶ֫רֶד","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">יֶ֫רֶד</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  son of Mehallʾēl, fourth generation from Seth <a data-ref=\"Genesis 5:16\" href=\"/Genesis.5.16\">Gn 5:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 5:18\" href=\"/Genesis.5.18\">18</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 5:19\" href=\"/Genesis.5.19\">19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 5:20\" href=\"/Genesis.5.20\">20</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יָ֑רֶד</span> v <a data-ref=\"Genesis 5:15\" href=\"/Genesis.5.15\">15</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:2\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.2\">1 Ch 1:2</a>; 𝔊 Ιαρεδ (v. Lag<sup>BN 77</sup>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">יֶרֶד</span> man of Judah <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 4:18\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.4.18\">1 Ch 4:18</a>; 𝔊 <em>id.</em>","next":"BDB, מוֹרָד","prev":"BDB, יָרַד"}